<% content_for :title, "What Is Domestic Violence? | SafeSpace Malaysia" %>

<div class="what-is-page">
  <section class="what-is-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
          <span class="what-is-eyebrow">
            <i class="bi bi-heart-pulse-fill me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            UNDERSTANDING DOMESTIC VIOLENCE
          </span>
          <h1 class="what-is-title mt-3">Everyone deserves to feel safe at home.</h1>
          <p class="what-is-intro mt-4">
            Domestic violence is a pattern of behaviour used to hurt, frighten,
            control or dominate someone in a family or intimate relationship.
            It is not always visible, and it is never the survivor's fault.
          </p>
          <a class="what-is-hero-link" href="#what-it-can-look-like">
            Learn how to recognise it <i class="bi bi-arrow-down ms-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-4">
          <aside class="what-is-reassurance" aria-label="A reminder">
            <span class="what-is-reassurance-icon">
              <i class="bi bi-shield-heart-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </span>
            <h2>You are not alone.</h2>
            <p>You deserve support, respect and a life free from fear.</p>
            <%= link_to "Find help in Malaysia", hotline_path, class: "what-is-help-link" %>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="what-is-section" id="what-it-can-look-like">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="what-is-section-heading">
        <span class="what-is-eyebrow">IT CAN TAKE MANY FORMS</span>
        <h2>Abuse is not always physical.</h2>
        <p>
          A person may experience one or several forms of abuse. These behaviours
          can happen in any relationship and may become more frequent or severe over time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4 mt-2">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <article class="what-is-card">
            <span class="what-is-card-icon what-is-icon-pink"><i class="bi bi-bandaid-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <h3>Physical</h3>
            <p>Hitting, slapping, choking, pushing, restraining, or causing injury in any way.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <article class="what-is-card">
            <span class="what-is-card-icon what-is-icon-purple"><i class="bi bi-chat-heart-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <h3>Emotional and psychological</h3>
            <p>Threats, humiliation, intimidation, isolation, constant monitoring, or making someone afraid.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <article class="what-is-card">
            <span class="what-is-card-icon what-is-icon-blue"><i class="bi bi-wallet-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <h3>Financial</h3>
            <p>Controlling money, preventing someone from working, withholding necessities, or taking their earnings.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <article class="what-is-card">
            <span class="what-is-card-icon what-is-icon-green"><i class="bi bi-person-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <h3>Sexual</h3>
            <p>Any sexual activity or contact without freely given consent, including within a relationship or marriage.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <article class="what-is-card">
            <span class="what-is-card-icon what-is-icon-amber"><i class="bi bi-phone-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <h3>Digital and coercive control</h3>
            <p>Tracking someone's location, demanding passwords, repeated unwanted messages, or controlling who they can see.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <article class="what-is-card">
            <span class="what-is-card-icon what-is-icon-teal"><i class="bi bi-house-door-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <h3>Threats and intimidation</h3>
            <p>Threatening a person, their children, or someone they care about, or damaging belongings to cause fear.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="what-is-section what-is-soft-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-start g-5">
        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <span class="what-is-eyebrow">RECOGNISING THE SIGNS</span>
          <h2 class="what-is-subtitle mt-2">It may begin with control, not violence.</h2>
          <p class="what-is-copy mt-3">
            Abuse is about power and control. Someone experiencing it may feel
            isolated, anxious, or unable to make everyday choices freely.
            Only they can decide what feels safe for them.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <div class="what-is-signs">
            <div class="what-is-sign">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <p>They monitor your calls, messages, movements, or social media.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="what-is-sign">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <p>They try to keep you away from friends, family, work, or study.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="what-is-sign">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <p>You change what you do or say because you are afraid of their reaction.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="what-is-sign">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <p>They blame you for their behaviour or say the abuse is your fault.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="what-is-sign">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <p>They control access to money, transport, identification, or healthcare.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="what-is-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="what-is-malaysia">
        <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">
          <div class="col-lg-5">
            <span class="what-is-eyebrow">KNOW THE MALAYSIAN CONTEXT</span>
            <h2 class="what-is-subtitle mt-2">Protection and support are available.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-7">
            <p class="what-is-copy">
              In Malaysia, the Domestic Violence Act 1994 (Act 521), read together
              with other applicable laws, provides a framework for protection from
              domestic violence. Depending on the circumstances, protection may
              include an Emergency Protection Order (EPO), Interim Protection
              Order (IPO), or Protection Order (PO).
            </p>
            <p class="what-is-copy">
              The Act covers specified family relationships and forms of abuse.
              Eligibility and the steps to seek protection depend on individual
              circumstances. The Department of Social Welfare (JKM), the police,
              or a qualified legal adviser can explain current options.
            </p>
            <%= link_to law_enforcement_path, class: "what-is-text-link" do %>
              Learn about the law and protection
              <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <% end %>
            <p class="what-is-disclaimer mt-3 mb-0">
              This page provides general information, not legal advice.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="what-is-section what-is-help-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="what-is-help-panel">
        <div>
          <span class="what-is-eyebrow">A FIRST STEP, WHEN YOU FEEL READY</span>
          <h2 class="mt-2">If you are worried about yourself or someone else</h2>
          <p>
            If it is safe, reach out to someone you trust or contact a support
            service to talk through options. You do not have to make every decision today.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="what-is-emergency">
          <i class="bi bi-telephone-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div>
            <strong>In immediate danger?</strong>
            <p>Call Malaysia's emergency number, <a href="tel:999">999</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <%= link_to hotline_path, class: "btn btn-primary-custom" do %>
          View support and hotline information
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <% end %>
        <p class="what-is-safety-note mb-0">
          If your device or browsing may be monitored, use a safer device when seeking help if possible.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
